 not a critical success) on the roll instead of rolling.</p>"},"frequency":{"max":1,"per":"day","value":1},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["fortune","occult"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!ujIO4WzzAM7aXBOE.tFc2Cv8iWNtqUXjr"},{"_id":"iMQHHiysaOGqvpF9","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.TTCw5NusiSSkJU1x"},"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Void Healing","sort":400000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","description":{"value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.NegativeHealing]</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":"Pathfinder Bestiary 2"},"rules":[{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"override","path":"system.attributes.hp.negativeHealing","value":true}],"slug":"negative-healing","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!ujIO4WzzAM7aXBOE.iMQHHiysaOGqvpF9"},{"_id":"ZGaQjs8d0aeyJrg7","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Drain Life","sort":500000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>When Valgomorus damages a living creature with his claw Strike, he gains 3 temporary Hit Points and the creature must succeed at a @Check[fortitude|dc:19|options:inflicts:drained] save or become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 1}.</p>\n<p>Further successful claw Strikes increase the drained value by 1 on a failed save, to a maximum of drained 4.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-effects.Item.LRIYUFQ7FE9H4RWD]{Effect: Drain Life}</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"override","path":"flags.system.drainLifeTempHP","value":3}],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["divine"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!ujIO4WzzAM7aXBOE.ZGaQjs8d0aeyJrg7"},{"_id":"cf7ANCTMyOtyXFkW","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp","name":"Swipe","sort":600000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":2},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>Valgomorus makes a melee Strike and compares the attack roll result to the AC of up to two foes, each of whom must be within his melee reach and adjacent to each other. Roll damage only once and apply it to each creature hit. A counts as two attacks for the multiple attack penalty, though the penalty does not increase until after both attacks are resolved.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["flourish"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!ujIO4WzzAM7aXBOE.cf7ANCTMyOtyXFkW"},{"_id":"2webGMKTaL6lqCD7","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Wight Spawn","sort":700000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>A living humanoid slain by Valgomorus's claw Strike rises as a spawned wight after [[/gmr 1d4 #rounds]]{1d4 rounds}. This spawned wight is under the command of the wight that killed it (in this case, Valgomorus). It doesn't have drain life or wight spawn and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{Clumsy 2} for as long as it is a spawned wight.</p>\n<p>If the creator of the spawned wight dies, the spawned wight becomes a full-fledged, autonomous wight; it regains its free will, gains drain life and wight spawn, and is no longer clumsy.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["divine"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!ujIO4WzzAM7aXBOE.2webGMKTaL6lqCD7"}],"name":"Valgomorus (3-4)","prototypeToken":{"name":"Valgomorus","texture":{"src":"modules/pf2e-dungeon-crawl/assets/creature-art/pfs-season-2-bestiary/valgomorus-lob.webp"}},"system":{"abilities":{"cha":{"mod":2},"con":{"mod":5},"dex":{"mod":-1},"int":{"mod":2},"str":{"mod":5},"wis":{"mod":4}},"attributes":{"ac":{"details":"","value":20},"allSaves":{"value":""},"hp":{"details":"void healing","max":75,"temp":0,"value":75},"immunities":[{"type":"bleed"},{"type":"death-effects"},{"type":"disease"},{"type":"mental"},{"type":"paralyzed"},{"type":"poison"},{"type":"unconscious"}],"resistances":[{"type":"cold","value":5},{"type":"electricity","value":5},{"type":"fire","value":5},{"type":"piercing","value":5},{"type":"slashing","value":5}],"speed":{"otherSpeeds":[],"value":20}},"details":{"blurb":"","languages":{"details":"","value":["aklo","azlanti","cyclops","draconic","empyrean","jotun"]},"level":{"value":5},"privateNotes":"","publicNotes":"","publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":"Pathfinder Society Scenario #2-01: Citadel of Corruption"}},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"perception":{"details":"","mod":15,"senses":[{"type":"darkvision"}]},"resources":{},"saves":{"fortitude":{"saveDetail":"","value":14},"reflex":{"saveDetail":"","value":9},"will":{"saveDetail":"","value":13}},"skills":{"athletics":{"base":15},"intimidation":{"base":12},"relig